        "id": 6,
        "raw": "[name=\"大鲍勃\"]   哈，果然......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "大鲍勃",
        "content": "哈，果然......"
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010#2\",name2=\"char_1002_nsabr_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010#2.png",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "raw": "[name=\"整合运动\"]   鲍勃！你，你在流血！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "整合运动",
        "content": "鲍勃！你，你在流血！"
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "[name=\"整合运动\"]   我们不能在这里白白流血！我还能——",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "整合运动",
        "content": "我们不能在这里白白流血！我还能——"
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010#2\",name2=\"char_1002_nsabr_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010#2.png",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[name=\"大鲍勃\"]   够了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "大鲍勃",
        "content": "够了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010#2\",name2=\"char_1002_nsabr_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010#2.png",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"整合运动\"]   鲍勃......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "整合运动",
        "content": "鲍勃......"
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010#2\",name2=\"char_1002_nsabr_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010#2.png",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[name=\"大鲍勃\"]   我们流过的血还少吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "大鲍勃",
        "content": "我们流过的血还少吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_263_skadi#2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[name=\"斯卡蒂\"]   还要打吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "斯卡蒂",
        "content": "还要打吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010#2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010#2.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[name=\"大鲍勃\"]   哼，我们为了活命而战斗，为什么要在战斗中送命？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "大鲍勃",
        "content": "哼，我们为了活命而战斗，为什么要在战斗中送命？"
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"大鲍勃\"]   我不够强，我认命了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "大鲍勃",
        "content": "我不够强，我认命了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010#2\",name2=\"char_220_grani#4\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010#2.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4"
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   ......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "......"
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_010\",name2=\"avg_npc_003\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   鲍勃，抱歉......没有这箱宝藏，我们的村子就完了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "鲍勃，抱歉......没有这箱宝藏，我们的村子就完了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_263_skadi#2\",name2=\"avg_npc_003\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"斯卡蒂\"]   离那箱东西远一点。把钥匙交给我。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "斯卡蒂",
        "content": "离那箱东西远一点。把钥匙交给我。"
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_263_skadi#2\",name2=\"avg_npc_003\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[CameraShake(duration=0.3, xstrength=10, ystrength=12, vibrato=30, randomness=30, fadeout=true, block=true)]",
        "type": "camera_shake",
        "duration": "0.3,",
        "xstrength": "10,",
        "ystrength": "12,",
        "vibrato": "30,",
        "randomness": "30,",
        "fadeout": "true,",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   呜，呜?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "呜，呜?"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_263_skadi#2\",name2=\"avg_npc_003\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"斯卡蒂\"]   在你用那把钥匙打开宝箱的一瞬间，你会没命的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "斯卡蒂",
        "content": "在你用那把钥匙打开宝箱的一瞬间，你会没命的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_263_skadi#2\",name2=\"avg_npc_003\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   我————",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "我————"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   这可是家里历代流传的贵重物品，父亲说我们最重要的职责之一就是要负责保管这枚钥匙——",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "这可是家里历代流传的贵重物品，父亲说我们最重要的职责之一就是要负责保管这枚钥匙——"
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_263_skadi#2\",name2=\"avg_npc_003\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"斯卡蒂\"]   ——钥匙使用后会割破你的手，吸走你的血。如果不是你这样的库兰塔人的血的话，钥匙就毁了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "斯卡蒂",
        "content": "——钥匙使用后会割破你的手，吸走你的血。如果不是你这样的库兰塔人的血的话，钥匙就毁了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"斯卡蒂\"]   把钥匙给我！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "斯卡蒂",
        "content": "把钥匙给我！"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   不行，这是村子里的所有人的未来。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "不行，这是村子里的所有人的未来。"
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_220_grani#1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   唔。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "唔。"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   这些都是真的吗，斯卡蒂？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "这些都是真的吗，斯卡蒂？"
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_263_skadi#2\",name2=\"char_220_grani#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"斯卡蒂\"]   藏匿了骑士宝藏的人，为了守护骑士的秘密，不择手段。只有——",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "斯卡蒂",
        "content": "藏匿了骑士宝藏的人，为了守护骑士的秘密，不择手段。只有——"
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   ——只有来自卡西米尔的血脉才能破除所有的阻碍。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "——只有来自卡西米尔的血脉才能破除所有的阻碍。"
