    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   可萝尔。能把钥匙给我看看吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "可萝尔。能把钥匙给我看看吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[name=\"可萝尔\"]   我......好。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "可萝尔",
        "content": "我......好。"
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_220_grani#3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#3.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   这个钥匙也不是很大不是吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "这个钥匙也不是很大不是吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_263_skadi#2\",name2=\"char_220_grani#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2.png",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[name=\"斯卡蒂\"]   虽然它不大，但是它吸走的血液量，一般人恐怕撑不住——",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "斯卡蒂",
        "content": "虽然它不大，但是它吸走的血液量，一般人恐怕撑不住——"
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_220_grani#1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[name=\"格拉尼\"]   所以，这个怪物钥匙，吸走的血是有限的吧？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "格拉尼",
        "content": "所以，这个怪物钥匙，吸走的血是有限的吧？"
